msgstr "fotogramas por segundo"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneFrameRate.qml
msgid ""
"A ceiling: what the user or the battery sets is never exceeded, and the "
"content never goes above its own rate."
msgstr ""
"Es un tope: nunca se supera lo que fija el usuario o la batería, y el "
"contenido no pasa de su propio ritmo."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGizmoDepth.qml
msgid ""
"Tilt around the width %1°: drag this end of the upright axis toward or away "
"from the pivot"
msgstr ""
"Inclinación sobre el ancho %1°: arrastra este extremo del eje vertical hacia "
"el pivote o lejos de él"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGizmoDepth.qml
msgid ""
"Tilt around the height %1°: drag this end of the level axis toward or away "
"from the pivot"
msgstr ""
"Inclinación sobre el alto %1°: arrastra este extremo del eje horizontal "
"hacia el pivote o lejos de él"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGizmoDepth.qml
msgid ""
"Depth %1 px: drag along the line out of the layer to bring it toward the "
"viewer or send it back"
msgstr ""
"Profundidad %1 px: arrastra a lo largo de la línea que sale de la capa para "
"acercarla a quien mira o alejarla"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGizmoKnobs.qml
msgid "Scale from the pivot; Shift keeps the proportions"
msgstr "Escalar desde el pivote; Mayús mantiene las proporciones"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGizmoKnobs.qml
