msgid "Value"
msgstr "Valor"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraph.qml
#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphButton.qml
msgid "Curve editor"
msgstr "Editor de curvas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraph.qml
msgid "No keys to show: add keyframes to a value first."
msgstr "No hay claves que mostrar: primero añade fotogramas clave a un valor."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraph.qml
msgid ""
"Click a key to pick it, Ctrl+click to add it, drag around keys to pick "
"several. Drag picked keys to move them in time and value (keys of several "
"values too, when they are of one kind and unit), Alt and drag to scale their "
"values, the grip at the right of the selection to stretch their times, and "
"the round handles to bend the curve. Each track is drawn on its own scale."
msgstr ""
"Un clic elige una clave, Ctrl+clic la suma y arrastrar alrededor de varias "
"las elige juntas. Arrastra las claves elegidas para moverlas en el tiempo y "
"en el valor (también claves de varios valores, si son de un mismo tipo y "
"unidad), con Alt para escalar sus valores, la manija a la derecha de la "
"selección para estirar sus tiempos y las asas redondas para curvar la línea. "
"Cada pista se dibuja con su propia escala."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphButton.qml
msgid ""
"Curve editor: the curves of the values part by part, with handles, several "
"keys at once, copy and paste"
msgstr ""
"Editor de curvas: las curvas de los valores parte por parte, con asas, "
"varias claves a la vez, copiar y pegar"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Aligned handles"
msgstr "Asas alineadas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Broken handles"
msgstr "Asas rotas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid ""
"Aligned: dragging one handle of a key turns the other one with it. Broken: "
"each handle moves alone."
msgstr ""
"Alineadas: al arrastrar un asa de una clave, la otra gira con ella. Rotas: "
"cada asa se mueve sola."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Linked parts"
msgstr "Partes unidas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Separate parts"
msgstr "Partes separadas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid ""
"Linked: a handle dragged on one track of a position or a color bends every "
"part of it. Separate: each track keeps handles of its own. Linking again "
"gives the picked key the shape of its first part."
msgstr ""
"Unidas: un asa arrastrada en una pista de una posición o un color curva "
"todas sus partes. Separadas: cada pista tiene sus propias asas. Volver a "
"unirlas le da a la clave elegida la forma de su primera parte."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Straighten"
msgstr "Enderezar"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Copiar"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Paste at the playhead"
msgstr "Pegar en el cabezal"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Remove the picked keys"
msgstr "Quitar las claves elegidas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Stretch times ×"
msgstr "Estirar tiempos ×"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Scale values ×"
msgstr "Escalar valores ×"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid ""
"Scales the values of the picked keys around the middle of each part, for "
"keys of values of one kind and unit. Alt and drag a picked key does the same "
"on its track."
msgstr ""
"Escala los valores de las claves elegidas alrededor del medio de cada parte, "
"si son claves de valores de un mismo tipo y unidad. Alt y arrastrar una "
"clave elegida hace lo mismo en su pista."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Fit the picked keys (F)"
msgstr "Encuadrar lo elegido (F)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "Fit all keys (Home)"
msgstr "Encuadrar todo (Inicio)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGraphTools.qml
msgid "%1 picked"
msgstr "%1 elegidas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGrip.qml
msgid "Panel edge"
msgstr "Borde del panel"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneGrip.qml
msgid ""
"Drag or use the arrow keys to resize; double click to return to the default "
"size"
msgstr ""
"Arrastra o usa las flechas para cambiar el tamaño; con doble clic vuelve a "
"su tamaño de siempre"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneHandover.qml
msgid "Hand an online author over to a new key"
msgstr "Traspasar un autor en línea a una clave nueva"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneHandover.qml
msgid ""
"Sign with the key that signed the earlier versions; the server accepts the "
"new public key for that author."
msgstr ""
"Firma con la clave que firmó las versiones anteriores; el servidor acepta la "
"clave pública nueva para ese autor."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneHandover.qml
msgid "Password of the old key:"
msgstr "Contraseña de la clave vieja:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneHandover.qml
msgid "New public key:"
msgstr "Clave pública nueva:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneHandover.qml
msgid "Author id:"
msgstr "Id del autor:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneHandover.qml
msgid "Sign the hand-over"
msgstr "Firmar el traspaso"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneHandover.qml
msgid "Signature:"
msgstr "Firma:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneIkKnobs.qml
msgid "Bends clockwise; click to bend the other way"
msgstr "Se dobla en sentido horario; pulsa para doblarla al otro lado"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneIkKnobs.qml
msgid "Bends counterclockwise; click to bend the other way"
msgstr "Se dobla en sentido antihorario; pulsa para doblarla al otro lado"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneImportSheet.qml
msgid "Import a sprite sheet or a data map"
msgstr "Importar una hoja de sprites o un mapa de datos"

