msgstr "Cortar en celdas iguales"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneImportSheet.qml
msgid "Rows:"
msgstr "Filas:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneImportSheet.qml
msgid "Columns:"
msgstr "Columnas:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneImportSheet.qml
msgid "Data:"
msgstr "Datos:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneImportSheet.qml
msgid "Read it as data, such as a normal map or a mask, not as colors"
msgstr ""
"Leerla como datos, como un mapa de normales o una máscara, no como colores"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneInspector.qml
msgid "Edit the particle system"
msgstr "Editar el sistema de partículas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyBase.qml
msgid "Straighten the curve"
msgstr "Enderezar la curva"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyBase.qml
msgid "The keyframes are added to this base value:"
msgstr "Los fotogramas clave se suman a este valor base:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyBase.qml
msgid "Make the keyframes relative by adding them to a base value:"
msgstr "Haz relativos los fotogramas clave sumándolos a un valor base:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyBase.qml
msgid "A number, [x, y] or a color"
msgstr "Un número, [x, y] o un color"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyBase.qml
msgid "Set the base"
msgstr "Fijar la base"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyBase.qml
msgid "Absolute"
msgstr "Absoluto"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyCurve.qml
msgid "Curve to the next keyframe"
msgstr "Curva hasta el siguiente fotograma clave"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyCurve.qml
msgid ""
"Handles bend the curve between two keyframes of numbers, lists of numbers or "
"colors; pick one that has another after it."
msgstr ""
"Las asas curvan el tramo entre dos claves de números, listas de números o "
"colores; elige una que tenga otra después."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyCurve.qml
msgid ""
"Drag the two handles to bend how the number moves between the keyframes."
msgstr ""
"Arrastra los dos tiradores para curvar cómo cambia el número entre los "
"fotogramas clave."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyCurve.qml
msgid ""
"Drag the two handles to bend how fast the value goes from one keyframe to "
"the next: the height is the share of the way, from 0 to 1."
msgstr ""
"Arrastra las dos asas para curvar lo rápido que va el valor de una clave a "
"la siguiente: la altura es la parte del camino, de 0 a 1."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyMenu.qml apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneTimeBar.qml
msgid "Curve and base of the keyframe"
msgstr "Curva y base del fotograma clave"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyMenu.qml apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneTimeBar.qml
msgid "Remove the keyframe"
msgstr "Quitar el fotograma clave"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeyMenu.qml
#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneTimelineMenu.qml
