#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "Replaced the key pair %1; its fingerprint is %2."
msgstr "Se reemplazó el par de claves %1; su huella es %2."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "Created the key pair %1; its fingerprint is %2."
msgstr "Se creó el par de claves %1; su huella es %2."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid ""
"%1.key is your SECRET key: never share it, and keep a copy somewhere safe. "
"%1.pub is the public key: give it to whoever must check your signatures."
msgstr ""
"%1.key es tu clave SECRETA: no la compartas nunca y guarda una copia en un "
"lugar seguro. %1.pub es la clave pública: entrégala a quien deba comprobar "
"tus firmas."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "Signed the hand-over from %1 to %2"
msgstr "Se firmó el traspaso de %1 a %2"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid ""
"Secret keys stay in %1, readable only by you. Nothing here ever shows one; "
"keep a copy somewhere safe, because a lost key cannot be recovered."
msgstr ""
"Las claves secretas se guardan en %1, legibles solo por ti. Aquí nunca se "
"muestra ninguna; guarda una copia en un lugar seguro, porque una clave "
"perdida no se puede recuperar."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "password"
msgstr "contraseña"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "Use to sign"
msgstr "Usar para firmar"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "There are no keys yet."
msgstr "Todavía no hay claves."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "New key pair"
msgstr "Par de claves nuevo"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "author"
msgstr "autor"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "Password:"
msgstr "Contraseña:"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "Create the key pair"
msgstr "Crear el par de claves"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid "Replace the key pair?"
msgstr "¿Reemplazar el par de claves?"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKeys.qml
msgid ""
"A key pair named %1 already exists. Replacing it destroys its secret key for "
"good: packages signed with it can no longer be followed by new versions you "
"sign."
msgstr ""
"Ya existe un par de claves llamado %1. Reemplazarlo destruye su clave "
"secreta para siempre: las versiones nuevas que firmes con otra clave no se "
"aceptarán como actualización de los paquetes que firmó."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Desktop graphics cards (BC7)"
msgstr "Tarjetas gráficas de escritorio (BC7)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Phones (ASTC)"
msgstr "Teléfonos (ASTC)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Older phones (ETC2)"
msgstr "Teléfonos más viejos (ETC2)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Any other card (uncompressed)"
msgstr "Cualquier otra tarjeta (sin comprimir)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Convert %1 to KTX2"
msgstr "Convertir %1 a KTX2"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Convert"
msgstr "Convertir"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid ""
"A KTX2 texture stays compressed on the graphics card: it takes about a "
"quarter of the memory of a picture and loads faster, most of all on phones. "
"Each card gets the format it reads best; the crops below show what each one "
"draws."
msgstr ""
"Una textura KTX2 sigue comprimida en la tarjeta gráfica: ocupa cerca de la "
"cuarta parte de la memoria de una imagen y carga más rápido, sobre todo en "
"teléfonos. Cada tarjeta recibe el formato que mejor lee; los recortes de "
"abajo muestran lo que dibuja cada una."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Sharper (UASTC)"
msgstr "Más nítida (UASTC)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Smaller file (ETC1S)"
msgstr "Archivo más pequeño (ETC1S)"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "Quality"
msgstr "Calidad"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid "File: %1 now, %2 as KTX2, with %3 levels of detail."
msgstr "Archivo: %1 ahora, %2 como KTX2, con %3 niveles de detalle."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SceneKtx2.qml
msgid ""
"The %1 frames become one texture array that keeps their timing; the crops "
"show the first frame."
msgstr ""
"Los %1 cuadros pasan a ser un arreglo de texturas que conserva su ritmo; los "
"recortes muestran el primer cuadro."

