msgstr "Lo que pueden usar las escenas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsGrants.qml
msgid ""
"A wallpaper follows the sound that plays or the pointer, or takes clicks, "
"only after you allow it for that wallpaper, and only while it is shown; "
"clicks also have to be turned on for each screen in its wallpaper settings. "
"The sound is turned into levels on this computer and never recorded, kept or "
"sent; pointer positions and clicks are never kept."
msgstr ""
