"Goes to the next wallpaper of the list. To change the combination, press "
"Enter and then the new keys."
msgstr ""
"Pasa al siguiente fondo de la lista. Para cambiar la combinación, pulsa "
"Intro y luego las teclas nuevas."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsMore.qml
#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsWallpapers.qml
msgid "Previous wallpaper with the keyboard"
msgstr "Volver al fondo anterior con el teclado"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsMore.qml
