"The desktop did not give the keys: bind reiwand-ctl next --preview and "
"reiwand-ctl prev --preview to your own keys"
msgstr ""
"El escritorio no dio los atajos: ata reiwand-ctl next --preview y reiwand-"
"ctl prev --preview a tus propias teclas"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsMore.qml
msgid "The desktop is asked for these two combinations"
msgstr "Se le piden al escritorio estas dos combinaciones"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsMore.qml
msgid ""
"Where the desktop cannot give them, bind the commands of the terminal tool "
"to your own keys."
msgstr ""
"Donde el escritorio no puede darlas, asigna los comandos de la herramienta "
"de terminal a tus propias teclas."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsMore.qml
