#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/facade/SettingsMachineRows.qml
msgid "Send colors to RGB lighting"
msgstr "Mandar colores a la iluminación RGB"

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsRgb.qml
msgid ""
"Wallpapers that send colors to keyboards, mice and other lights reach them "
"through an OpenRGB server, and only after you allow it for each package. "
"Turn this on to let them; the address is this computer unless you change it."
msgstr ""
"Los fondos que mandan colores al teclado, el ratón y otras luces llegan a "
"ellas a través de un servidor de OpenRGB, y solo después de que lo permitas "
"para cada paquete. Enciende esto para dejarlos; la dirección es este equipo "
"salvo que la cambies."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsRgb.qml
msgid ""
"The colors of your wallpaper go over the network to %1. Anyone who can watch "
"that network could see them; use an address on this computer to keep them "
"here."
msgstr ""
"Los colores de tu fondo viajan por la red hasta %1. Quien pueda observar esa "
"red podría verlos; usa una dirección de este equipo para que no salgan de "
"aquí."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsRgb.qml
msgid "Connected; %1 sends the colors now."
msgstr "Conectado; ahora manda los colores %1."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsRgb.qml
msgid "Not connected."
msgstr "Sin conectar."

#: apps/reiwand-app/qml/SettingsRgb.qml
